0db517"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you want to spend money for about 20-30 hours of enjoyment, go right ahead, but this in general feels very limited, the items can seem interesting at first but stacking items falls off really quickly and there are so many items that are disingenuous (armor repulsion plate) that seem like they should be good, but are straight up trash. There should be more routes for stacking items and mixing up playstyles. The only meta that exists in this game is, attack speed, damage, and movement speed. There could be a lot more variety but the devs limit it so hard, (lysate cell stacking with engineer), Honestly it's a 10/10 at first, but after unlocking a few characters and beating the game, 4/10, probably less.", "timestamp_created": 1705361901, "timestamp_updated": 1705361901, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}]}